{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-realtime","title":"实时协作应用测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/production-ready/testing-realtime","wordCount":1492,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"实时协作应用测试\">实时协作应用测试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>实时协作应用的测试比传统应用复杂得多，涉及多客户端模拟、CRDT 收敛验证、网络状况模拟、离线场景、冲突解决等方面。常用工具包括 Playwright 多页面模式（模拟多用户）、Yjs 测试工具（应用更新并验证）、网络限流工具，以及 WebSocket 专用的压力测试工具（k6 / Artillery）。在 CI/CD 流程中对这些场景做回归测试至关重要。本节系统介绍测试策略、多客户端测试模式、CRDT 收敛测试、负载测试以及生产环境监控方案。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试（CRDT 逻辑）</td>\n<td>Vitest / Jest</td>\n<td>CRDT 变换正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>Yjs apply + verify</td>\n<td>文档一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端多客户端测试</td>\n<td>Playwright 多页面</td>\n<td>真实用户流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络状况测试</td>\n<td>DevTools 限流 / Toxiproxy</td>\n<td>离线与慢网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载测试</td>\n<td>k6 / Artillery（WebSocket）</td>\n<td>服务端扩展性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产监控</td>\n<td>Prometheus / Datadog</td>\n<td>线上健康状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"单元测试-crdt-逻辑\">单元测试 CRDT 逻辑</h2><p><strong>测试变换正确性</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import * as Y from &#39;yjs&#39;;&#10;import { describe, it, expect } from &#39;vitest&#39;;&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;CRDT merge&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;two clients edit text concurrently&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const doc1 = new Y.Doc();&#10;    const doc2 = new Y.Doc();&#10;&#10;    const text1 = doc1.getText(&#39;content&#39;);&#10;    const text2 = doc2.getText(&#39;content&#39;);&#10;&#10;    text1.insert(0, &#39;Hello &#39;);&#10;    text2.insert(0, &#39;World &#39;);&#10;&#10;    // 同步&#10;    Y.applyUpdate(doc2, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc1));&#10;    Y.applyUpdate(doc1, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc2));&#10;&#10;    // 两端收敛&#10;    expect(text1.toString()).toBe(text2.toString());&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;handles delete + insert&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const doc1 = new Y.Doc();&#10;    const doc2 = new Y.Doc();&#10;&#10;    const text1 = doc1.getText(&#39;t&#39;);&#10;    text1.insert(0, &#39;Hello&#39;);&#10;&#10;    Y.applyUpdate(doc2, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc1));&#10;&#10;    const text2 = doc2.getText(&#39;t&#39;);&#10;    text1.delete(0, 1); // 删除 &#39;H&#39;&#10;    text2.insert(5, &#39;!&#39;); // 追加 &#39;!&#39;&#10;&#10;    Y.applyUpdate(doc1, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc2));&#10;    Y.applyUpdate(doc2, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc1));&#10;&#10;    expect(text1.toString()).toBe(text2.toString());&#10;    expect(text1.toString()).toBe(&#39;ello!&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import * as Y from 'yjs';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { describe, it, expect } from 'vitest';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe('CRDT merge', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  it('two clients edit text concurrently', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const doc1 = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const doc2 = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const text1 = doc1.getText('content');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const text2 = doc2.getText('content');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text1.insert(0, 'Hello ');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text2.insert(0, 'World ');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Y.applyUpdate(doc2, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Y.applyUpdate(doc1, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc2));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 两端收敛</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(text1.toString()).toBe(text2.toString());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  it('handles delete + insert', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const doc1 = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const doc2 = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const text1 = doc1.getText('t');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text1.insert(0, 'Hello');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Y.applyUpdate(doc2, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const text2 = doc2.getText('t');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text1.delete(0, 1); // 删除 'H'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text2.insert(5, '!'); // 追加 '!'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Y.applyUpdate(doc1, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc2));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Y.applyUpdate(doc2, Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(text1.toString()).toBe(text2.toString());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(text1.toString()).toBe('ello!');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>覆盖要点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CRDT 核心属性（交换律、幂等性）。</li>\n<li>具体的边界条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试\">集成测试</h2><p><strong>测试完整的同步流程</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { WebSocket } from &#39;ws&#39;;&#10;import * as Y from &#39;yjs&#39;;&#10;import { WebsocketProvider } from &#39;y-websocket&#39;;&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;Sync via WebSocket&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;two clients sync&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const doc1 = new Y.Doc();&#10;    const provider1 = new WebsocketProvider(&#39;ws://localhost:1234&#39;, &#39;test&#39;, doc1);&#10;&#10;    const doc2 = new Y.Doc();&#10;    const provider2 = new WebsocketProvider(&#39;ws://localhost:1234&#39;, &#39;test&#39;, doc2);&#10;&#10;    await new Promise((r) =&gt; setTimeout(r, 500)); // 等待连接建立&#10;&#10;    doc1.getText(&#39;t&#39;).insert(0, &#39;Hello&#39;);&#10;&#10;    await new Promise((r) =&gt; setTimeout(r, 500)); // 等待同步完成&#10;&#10;    expect(doc2.getText(&#39;t&#39;).toString()).toBe(&#39;Hello&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { WebSocket } from 'ws';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import * as Y from 'yjs';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { WebsocketProvider } from 'y-websocket';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe('Sync via WebSocket', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  it('two clients sync', async () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const doc1 = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const provider1 = new WebsocketProvider('ws://localhost:1234', 'test', doc1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const doc2 = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const provider2 = new WebsocketProvider('ws://localhost:1234', 'test', doc2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 500)); // 等待连接建立</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    doc1.getText('t').insert(0, 'Hello');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 500)); // 等待同步完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(doc2.getText('t').toString()).toBe('Hello');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"端到端多客户端-playwright-测试\">端到端多客户端 Playwright 测试</h2><p><strong>模拟两个用户</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { test, expect } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;&#10;test(&#39;two users see each other cursor&#39;, async ({ browser }) =&gt; {&#10;  // 两个浏览器上下文（模拟不同&quot;用户&quot;）&#10;  const ctx1 = await browser.newContext();&#10;  const ctx2 = await browser.newContext();&#10;&#10;  const page1 = await ctx1.newPage();&#10;  const page2 = await ctx2.newPage();&#10;&#10;  await page1.goto(&#39;https://app.example.com/doc/123&#39;);&#10;  await page2.goto(&#39;https://app.example.com/doc/123&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 用户 1 编辑&#10;  await page1.locator(&#39;.editor&#39;).type(&#39;Hello from User 1&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 用户 2 看到编辑内容&#10;  await expect(page2.locator(&#39;.editor&#39;)).toContainText(&#39;Hello from User 1&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 用户 1 移动鼠标&#10;  await page1.mouse.move(100, 200);&#10;&#10;  // 用户 2 看到用户 1 的光标&#10;  const cursor = page2.locator(&#39;.remote-cursor[data-user=&quot;user1&quot;]&#39;);&#10;  await expect(cursor).toBeVisible();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test('two users see each other cursor', async ({ browser }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 两个浏览器上下文（模拟不同\"用户\"）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const ctx1 = await browser.newContext();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const ctx2 = await browser.newContext();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const page1 = await ctx1.newPage();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const page2 = await ctx2.newPage();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page1.goto('https://app.example.com/doc/123');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page2.goto('https://app.example.com/doc/123');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 用户 1 编辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page1.locator('.editor').type('Hello from User 1');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 用户 2 看到编辑内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await expect(page2.locator('.editor')).toContainText('Hello from User 1');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 用户 1 移动鼠标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page1.mouse.move(100, 200);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 用户 2 看到用户 1 的光标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const cursor = page2.locator('.remote-cursor[data-user=\"user1\"]');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await expect(cursor).toBeVisible();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>覆盖要点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用真实浏览器的完整用户流程。</li>\n<li>光标与选区同步验证。</li>\n<li>冲突场景模拟。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"网络状况测试\">网络状况测试</h2><p><strong>离线场景</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"test(&#39;offline edit syncs on reconnect&#39;, async ({ page, context }) =&gt; {&#10;  await page.goto(&#39;/doc/123&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 断网&#10;  await context.setOffline(true);&#10;&#10;  await page.locator(&#39;.editor&#39;).type(&#39;Offline edit&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 验证本地已保存&#10;  const text = await page.locator(&#39;.editor&#39;).textContent();&#10;  expect(text).toContain(&#39;Offline edit&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 恢复网络&#10;  await context.setOffline(false);&#10;&#10;  // 等待同步&#10;  await page.waitForTimeout(2000);&#10;&#10;  // 验证服务端已接收（通过 API 校验）&#10;  // ...&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>test('offline edit syncs on reconnect', async ({ page, context }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page.goto('/doc/123');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 断网</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await context.setOffline(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page.locator('.editor').type('Offline edit');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 验证本地已保存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const text = await page.locator('.editor').textContent();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(text).toContain('Offline edit');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 恢复网络</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await context.setOffline(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 等待同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page.waitForTimeout(2000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 验证服务端已接收（通过 API 校验）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模拟慢速网络</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const ctx = await browser.newContext();&#10;ctx.route(&#39;**/*&#39;, (route) =&gt; {&#10;  setTimeout(() =&gt; route.continue(), 500); // 增加 500ms 延迟&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const ctx = await browser.newContext();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ctx.route('**/*', (route) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setTimeout(() => route.continue(), 500); // 增加 500ms 延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"负载测试\">负载测试</h2><p><strong>使用 k6 进行 WebSocket 负载测试</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import ws from &#39;k6/ws&#39;;&#10;import { check } from &#39;k6&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const options = {&#10;  vus: 1000, // 1000 个虚拟用户&#10;  duration: &#39;5m&#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;export default function () {&#10;  const url = &#39;wss://app.example.com&#39;;&#10;  const res = ws.connect(url, {}, function (socket) {&#10;    socket.on(&#39;open&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;      socket.send(JSON.stringify({ type: &#39;join&#39;, room: &#39;load-test&#39; }));&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    socket.on(&#39;message&#39;, (data) =&gt; {&#10;      // 验证响应&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    // 定期发送消息&#10;    socket.setInterval(() =&gt; {&#10;      socket.send(JSON.stringify({ type: &#39;edit&#39;, text: &#39;foo&#39; }));&#10;    }, 1000);&#10;&#10;    socket.setTimeout(() =&gt; {&#10;      socket.close();&#10;    }, 60000);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  check(res, { connected: (r) =&gt; r &amp;&amp; r.status === 101 });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import ws from 'k6/ws';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { check } from 'k6';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const options = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  vus: 1000, // 1000 个虚拟用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  duration: '5m',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default function () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const url = 'wss://app.example.com';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const res = ws.connect(url, {}, function (socket) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    socket.on('open', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      socket.send(JSON.stringify({ type: 'join', room: 'load-test' }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    socket.on('message', (data) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 验证响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 定期发送消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    socket.setInterval(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      socket.send(JSON.stringify({ type: 'edit', text: 'foo' }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }, 1000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    socket.setTimeout(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      socket.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }, 60000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  check(res, { connected: (r) => r &#x26;&#x26; r.status === 101 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>运行命令</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"k6 run load-test.js\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">k6</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> load-test.js</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关注指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>延迟 p50 / p95 / p99。</li>\n<li>连接成功率。</li>\n<li>错误率。</li>\n<li>服务端 CPU / 内存占用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"使用-artillery-进行-websocket-负载测试\">使用 Artillery 进行 WebSocket 负载测试</h2><p><strong>替代方案</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# artillery.yml&#10;config:&#10;  target: &#39;wss://app.example.com&#39;&#10;  phases:&#10;    - duration: 60&#10;      arrivalRate: 50&#10;&#10;scenarios:&#10;  - engine: ws&#10;    flow:&#10;      - send: &#39;{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;join&quot;,&quot;room&quot;:&quot;test&quot;}&#39;&#10;      - think: 1&#10;      - send: &#39;{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;edit&quot;}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># artillery.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wss://app.example.com'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  phases</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      arrivalRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">scenarios</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">engine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ws</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    flow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"type\":\"join\",\"room\":\"test\"}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">think</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"type\":\"edit\"}'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>运行命令</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"artillery run artillery.yml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">artillery</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> artillery.yml</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"冲突场景测试\">冲突场景测试</h2><p><strong>测试并发编辑</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"test(&#39;concurrent edit converges&#39;, async ({ browser }) =&gt; {&#10;  const [ctx1, ctx2] = await Promise.all([browser.newContext(), browser.newContext()]);&#10;&#10;  const [page1, page2] = await Promise.all([ctx1.newPage(), ctx2.newPage()]);&#10;&#10;  await Promise.all([page1.goto(&#39;/doc/concurrent&#39;), page2.goto(&#39;/doc/concurrent&#39;)]);&#10;&#10;  // 并发编辑&#10;  await Promise.all([page1.locator(&#39;.editor&#39;).type(&#39;AAA&#39;), page2.locator(&#39;.editor&#39;).type(&#39;BBB&#39;)]);&#10;&#10;  await page1.waitForTimeout(2000);&#10;&#10;  // 两端应该收敛&#10;  const text1 = await page1.locator(&#39;.editor&#39;).textContent();&#10;  const text2 = await page2.locator(&#39;.editor&#39;).textContent();&#10;&#10;  expect(text1).toBe(text2);&#10;  expect(text1).toContain(&#39;AAA&#39;);&#10;  expect(text1).toContain(&#39;BBB&#39;);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>test('concurrent edit converges', async ({ browser }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [ctx1, ctx2] = await Promise.all([browser.newContext(), browser.newContext()]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [page1, page2] = await Promise.all([ctx1.newPage(), ctx2.newPage()]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await Promise.all([page1.goto('/doc/concurrent'), page2.goto('/doc/concurrent')]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 并发编辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await Promise.all([page1.locator('.editor').type('AAA'), page2.locator('.editor').type('BBB')]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page1.waitForTimeout(2000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 两端应该收敛</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const text1 = await page1.locator('.editor').textContent();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const text2 = await page2.locator('.editor').textContent();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(text1).toBe(text2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(text1).toContain('AAA');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(text1).toContain('BBB');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[测试准备] --&gt; B[创建两个浏览器上下文]&#10;    B --&gt; C[两端访问同一文档]&#10;    C --&gt; D[并发编辑]&#10;    D --&gt; E[等待同步]&#10;    E --&gt; F[验证两端收敛]&#10;    F --&gt; G[验证内容包含双方输入]\">graph LR\n    A[测试准备] --&gt; B[创建两个浏览器上下文]\n    B --&gt; C[两端访问同一文档]\n    C --&gt; D[并发编辑]\n    D --&gt; E[等待同步]\n    E --&gt; F[验证两端收敛]\n    F --&gt; G[验证内容包含双方输入]</pre><h2 id=\"生产环境监控\">生产环境监控</h2><p><strong>需要追踪的指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发连接数。</li>\n<li>每秒消息速率。</li>\n<li>p50 / p99 延迟。</li>\n<li>重连率。</li>\n<li>错误率。</li>\n<li>同步冲突率（使用 CRDT 时通常很低）。</li>\n<li>文档体积增长趋势。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>常用工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prometheus + Grafana。</li>\n<li>Datadog。</li>\n<li>New Relic。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自定义遥测</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 追踪从本地编辑到服务端确认的耗时&#10;const startTime = performance.now();&#10;await applyEdit();&#10;const latency = performance.now() - startTime;&#10;sendMetric(&#39;edit_latency_ms&#39;, latency);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 追踪从本地编辑到服务端确认的耗时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const startTime = performance.now();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await applyEdit();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const latency = performance.now() - startTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sendMetric('edit_latency_ms', latency);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ci-cd-集成\">CI/CD 集成</h2><p><strong>在 PR 时运行测试</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/test.yml&#10;on: [pull_request]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  unit:&#10;    steps:&#10;      - run: npm test&#10;&#10;  e2e:&#10;    steps:&#10;      - run: npm run test:e2e&#10;&#10;  load:&#10;    steps:&#10;      - run: k6 run --duration 1m --vus 100 load-test.js\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/test.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  unit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  e2e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run test:e2e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">k6 run --duration 1m --vus 100 load-test.js</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>质量门禁</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单元测试全部通过。</li>\n<li>端到端测试全部通过。</li>\n<li>负载测试延迟低于阈值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"混沌测试\">混沌测试</h2><p><strong>使用 Toxiproxy(Chaos Testing)</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>注入各种网络异常状况。</li>\n<li>模拟延迟、丢包、断连。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"toxiproxy-cli create --listen :1234 --upstream localhost:8080 ws-server&#10;toxiproxy-cli toxic add ws-server -t latency -a latency=500\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toxiproxy-cli</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --listen</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :1234</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --upstream</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> localhost:8080</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ws-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toxiproxy-cli</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> toxic</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ws-server</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> latency</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> latency=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在混沌条件下验证应用的行为是否符合预期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存泄漏测试\">内存泄漏测试</h2><p><strong>长时间连接场景</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"test(&#39;no memory leak after 1 hour&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;  await page.goto(&#39;/doc/test&#39;);&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; 60; i++) {&#10;    await page.evaluate(() =&gt; {&#10;      // 模拟编辑&#10;      window.editor.insert(&#39;text&#39;);&#10;    });&#10;    await page.waitForTimeout(60_000); // 每分钟一次&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 检查内存&#10;  const metrics = await page.evaluate(() =&gt; performance.memory);&#10;  expect(metrics.usedJSHeapSize).toBeLessThan(threshold);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>test('no memory leak after 1 hour', async ({ page }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page.goto('/doc/test');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (let i = 0; i &#x3C; 60; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await page.evaluate(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 模拟编辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      window.editor.insert('text');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await page.waitForTimeout(60_000); // 每分钟一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 检查内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const metrics = await page.evaluate(() => performance.memory);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(metrics.usedJSHeapSize).toBeLessThan(threshold);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Y.Doc 内存增长的关注点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果不进行垃圾回收（GC），墓碑数据会导致内存持续增长。</li>\n<li>测试方法：反复执行编辑和删除操作。</li>\n<li>验证内存占用保持在合理范围内。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"视觉回归测试\">视觉回归测试</h2><p><strong>光标与选区的视觉验证</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { test } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;&#10;test(&#39;multiplayer cursors render correctly&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;  await page.goto(&#39;/test-collab-fixture&#39;);&#10;  await expect(page).toHaveScreenshot(&#39;cursors.png&#39;);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { test } from '@playwright/test';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test('multiplayer cursors render correctly', async ({ page }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await page.goto('/test-collab-fixture');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await expect(page).toHaveScreenshot('cursors.png');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 仅做单客户端测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>会遗漏协作相关的缺陷。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 不测试离线场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生产环境中用户离线时会出现故障。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 不做负载测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>发布后遭遇意外崩溃。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 不做混沌测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生产环境脆弱不堪。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 不监控生产环境</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>故障发生时无法及时发现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 仅验证 CRDT 属性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>会遗漏实际用户体验层面的缺陷。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 分层测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单元测试（CRDT）+ 集成测试（同步）+ 端到端测试（多客户端）+ 负载测试，层层覆盖。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. Playwright 多页面模式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这是协作应用测试的核心手段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 每个 PR 运行 CI</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>及时捕获回归问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 生产环境监控</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>追踪真实用户指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 发布前进行混沌测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>验证网络分区、慢速网络、断连等极端场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 内存增长测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>确保长时间运行不会泄漏。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"业界实践案例\">业界实践案例</h2><p><strong>Notion</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>大量内部测试覆盖。</li>\n<li>完善的生产遥测体系。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Linear</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TypeScript 优先的测试策略。</li>\n<li>端到端测试覆盖面广。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Figma</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自研测试框架。</li>\n<li>多用户模拟场景覆盖极为广泛。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>实时协作应用的测试涵盖多客户端模拟、CRDT 收敛验证、网络状况模拟、离线场景、冲突解决和负载测试等维度。单元测试使用 Vitest/Jest 验证并发编辑收敛、删除与插入组合、交换律与幂等性。集成测试通过 WebSocket 验证完整同步流程——两个文档连接、同步、验证一致性。端到端测试使用 Playwright 多页面模式创建两个浏览器上下文模拟不同用户，验证编辑可见性与光标同步。网络状况测试覆盖离线编辑后重连同步、慢速网络延迟注入。负载测试使用 k6 模拟上千并发 WebSocket 连接，关注连接成功率与延迟分位数；也可用 Artillery 作为替代方案。冲突场景测试验证并发编辑后两端收敛且内容完整。生产监控追踪并发连接数、消息速率、延迟分位数、重连率、错误率、文档体积增长，常用 Prometheus + Grafana 或 Datadog 配合自定义遥测。CI/CD 在每个 PR 上运行单元测试、端到端测试和负载测试，设置延迟阈值作为质量门禁。混沌测试使用 Toxiproxy 注入延迟、丢包、断连验证应用韧性。内存泄漏测试关注长时间运行下的堆内存增长，特别是 Y.Doc 墓碑数据的垃圾回收问题。视觉回归测试通过截图比对验证多人光标渲染正确性。避免仅做单客户端测试、忽略离线场景、不做负载测试和混沌测试、不监控生产环境等反模式。建议采用分层测试策略，将 Playwright 多页面模式作为协作测试核心，坚持 CI 回归检测，完善生产监控，发布前进行混沌测试，并关注长期内存增长。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实时协作应用测试","id":"实时协作应用测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单元测试 CRDT 逻辑","id":"单元测试-crdt-逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"集成测试","id":"集成测试"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端多客户端 Playwright 测试","id":"端到端多客户端-playwright-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"网络状况测试","id":"网络状况测试"},{"level":2,"text":"负载测试","id":"负载测试"},{"level":2,"text":"使用 Artillery 进行 WebSocket 负载测试","id":"使用-artillery-进行-websocket-负载测试"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突场景测试","id":"冲突场景测试"},{"level":2,"text":"生产环境监控","id":"生产环境监控"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 集成","id":"ci-cd-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"混沌测试","id":"混沌测试"},{"level":2,"text":"内存泄漏测试","id":"内存泄漏测试"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉回归测试","id":"视觉回归测试"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"业界实践案例","id":"业界实践案例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Liveblocks 与协作平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/production-ready/liveblocks-and-platforms"},"next":null}